config TAFMNGDCONNSVC_MAX_DATA_OBJECTS
  int "Maximum number of JSON data objects supported by the service."
  default 2
  range 1 16

config TAFMNGDCONNSVC_MAX_CLIENT_SESSIONS
  int "Maximum number of client sessions supported by the service."
  default 8
  range 1 20

config TAFMNGDCONNSVC_USE_CURL
  bool "Configures whether the service uses curl to make data connection tests."
  default n
  range 1 20
  help
    If enabled, the service will use curl to make data connection tests. If disabled, the service
    will use ping. Using curl requires the curl library to be installed on the target and it may
    increase the service's RAM usage.
